    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d322">

                <pb facs="0439" n="333" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg333"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Señor Matta to the intendente of
                    Valparaiso</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ministry of Foreign Relations</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-10-26"><hi rendition="#italic">October 26,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">D.</p>
                <p>I herewith send you an extract from a communication which has this day been
                    addressed to this department by the United States minister, relative to the
                    disturbance with seamen belonging to the cruiser <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Baltimore</hi>.</p>
                <p>Be pleased to send to this department, as speedily as possible, a report of the
                    examination held concerning this matter, the documents snowing the origin and
                    state of the investigation, if the examination is not concluded, and such other
                    antecedents as may show the course which has been pursued by the local
                    authorities.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">M. A. Matta</hi>.</p>
                <p>Correct.</p>
                <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. Bascuñan</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">Intendente</hi>.</p>
                <p>The foregoing agrees with the document on file at this legation.</p>
                <closer>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">l. s</hi>.] <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Aníbal Cruz</hi>.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-12-19"><hi rendition="#italic">December 19,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
